  "business_overview": "Twin Vee Powercats Co. designs, manufactures, and markets recreational and commercial power boats. The company offers catamaran boats, dual hull vessels, and Bahama Boat Works under the Twin Vee brand; and V-hull boats under the AquaSport brand for use in recreational activities, including fishing, diving and water-skiing, as well as commercial activities, such as transportation, eco tours, fishing, and diving expeditions. It sells its boats through a network of independent boat dealers in North America, Hawaii, and Australia. Twin Vee Powercats Co. was founded in 1996 and is headquartered in Fort Pierce, Florida.",
